{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster"]]},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/RandomizedSVD","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:12SwiftCluster13RandomizedSVDO","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"RandomizedSVD"}],"title":"RandomizedSVD","modules":[{"name":"SwiftCluster"}],"roleHeading":"Enumeration","symbolKind":"enum","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RandomizedSVD"}],"role":"symbol"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftcluster\/randomizedsvd"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Structures","anchor":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/RandomizedSVD\/Result"]},{"generated":true,"title":"Type Methods","anchor":"Type-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/RandomizedSVD\/compute(X:nComponents:nOversamples:nPowerIter:seed:)"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Randomized Singular Value Decomposition using the Halko et al. (2011) algorithm."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RandomizedSVD"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Computes an approximate rank-k SVD of an M×N matrix A:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A ≈ U * diag(S) * Vᵀ","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"where U is M×k orthonormal, S is k-vector of singular values, Vᵀ is k×N.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Complexity","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Complexity"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"O(M·N·k) — dramatically faster than full ","type":"text"},{"code":"dgesdd_","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" O(M·N²) when k ≪ min(M, N).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Algorithm-Halko-2011","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Algorithm (Halko 2011)"},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Draw random Gaussian matrix Ω ∈ ℝ^{N×(k+p)}  (p=10 oversampling).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Compute range sketch Y = A·Ω  via BLAS dgemm.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Orthonormalize Y via thin QR (dgeqrf + dorgqr).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Project B = Qᵀ·A  (small k×N matrix).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Compute small exact SVD of B with dgesdd_.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Back-project left singular vectors: U = Q·Ũ.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"anchor":"Reference","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Reference"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Halko N., Martinsson P.G., Tropp J.A. (2011). Finding Structure with Randomness:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Probabilistic Algorithms for Constructing Approximate Matrix Decompositions.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"SIAM Review 53(2):217–288.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://SwiftCluster/documentation/SwiftCluster/RandomizedSVD":{"abstract":[{"text":"Randomized Singular Value Decomposition using the Halko et al. (2011) algorithm.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiftcluster\/randomizedsvd","title":"RandomizedSVD","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RandomizedSVD"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"RandomizedSVD","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/d